# Icon exploration RENDERS (166 MB of intermediate 1024² PNGs across app-icon-v2/out*, out2…out4,
# unfitted-originals and app-icon-tv/previews). The generators that produce them ARE committed
# (design/app-icon-v2/*.py), and the icon that actually shipped lives in
# ios/Resources/AppIcon.icon and android/app/src/main/res — so these are regenerable scratch.
design/app-icon-v2/**/*.png
design/app-icon-tv/**/*.png
